# --- Local secrets and credentials -------------------------------------------
# Belt and braces: the per-project ignores below already cover the files the
# setup-secrets scripts write, but these patterns stop a stray copy, a sed
# backup or a new environment file from ever being staged by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

secrets.json
appsettings.Secrets.json
local-credentials.txt

*.bak
*.key
*.pem
*.pfx
*.p12
